<p class="field-help">難度會依作答統計調整，供檢討時參考；測驗滿分為 100.00 分。</p>
<% if(record) { %><div class="review-record-heading"><span><%= formatDate(record.submitted_at) %> · <%= formatScore(record.score) %> 分<%= record.is_demo ? ' · 示範紀錄' : '' %></span><a class="text-link" href="/results/latest?record=<%= record.id %>">返回本次成績 <%- icon('arrow') %></a></div><% } %>
<% if(practice) { %><div class="mode-tip" style="margin:0 0 22px"><%- icon('clock') %><span>練習測驗結果保留 1 小時。<% if(typeof practiceReview !== 'undefined' && practiceReview) { %>本次加權成績：<%= formatScore(practiceReview.score) %> 分。可檢討至 <time datetime="<%= new Date(practiceReview.expires_at*1000).toISOString() %>"><%= formatDate(practiceReview.expires_at) %></time>（台北時間）。<% } %>關閉頁面後，可從<a href="/results/latest">成績與檢討</a>回到檢討。</span></div><% } %>
<% if(rows.length) { %><section class="surface-card review-summary" aria-labelledby="review-summary-heading"><h2 id="review-summary-heading">作答一覽</h2><p class="field-help">點選題號可直接查看該題。O：答對；X：答錯；—：未作答。</p><nav class="review-answer-grid" aria-label="選擇檢討題目">
<% for(const row of rows) { const target=Math.ceil(row.position/pager.perPage); const status=row.missing ? '題目已移除' : row.selection==='N' ? '未作答' : row.correct ? '答對' : '答錯'; const url=target===pager.page ? '#question-'+row.position : pager.url(target,'question-'+row.position); %>
<a href="<%= url %>" class="review-answer-link <%= row.selection==='N' ? 'is-unanswered' : row.correct ? 'is-correct' : 'is-wrong' %> <%= target===pager.page ? 'is-visible' : '' %>" aria-label="第 <%= row.position %> 題，<%= status %>" title="第 <%= row.position %> 題，<%= status %>"><%= row.position %>：<%= row.missing ? '？' : row.selection==='N' ? '—' : row.correct ? 'O' : 'X' %></a><% } %></nav></section><% } %>
<%- include('../partials/pagination',{top:true}) %>
<% for(const question of questions) { if(question.missing) { %><article class="question-block review-question" id="question-<%= question.position %>"><h2><%= String(question.position).padStart(2,'0') %></h2><p>這道題目已從題庫移除，目前無法顯示題目與解析。</p><p>你的選項：<%= question.selection %> · 題目 ID：<%= question.question_id %></p></article><% continue; } %><article class="question-block review-question" id="question-<%= question.position %>"><h2><%= String(question.position).padStart(2,'0') %></h2><%- include('../partials/difficulty-rating',{question}) %><div class="question-content <%= question.difficulty ? 'preserve-whitespace' : '' %>"><%- question.question %></div>
<p><span class="badge <%= question.selection==='N' ? 'badge-muted' : !question.correct ? 'badge-danger' : '' %>">作答情形：<%= question.selection==='N' ? '未作答' : question.correct ? '正確' : '錯誤' %></span>　你的選項：<%= question.selection %>　正解：<%= question.answer %></p>
<% for(const option of options) { %><div class="answer-option <%= question.answer===option ? 'correct-answer' : '' %>"><span class="option-letter"><%= option %></span><span class="option-content <%= question.difficulty ? 'preserve-whitespace' : '' %>"><%- question[option] %></span><% if(question.selection===option) { %><span class="badge <%= !question.correct ? 'badge-danger' : '' %>" style="margin-left:auto">你的選擇</span><% } %></div><% } %><% if(question.explanation) { %><section class="ai-review-explanation"><h3>解析</h3><p class="preserve-whitespace"><%= question.explanation %></p></section><% } %><p class="question-code">題庫來源：<%= question.bank_name %></p></article><% } %>
<% if(!questions.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><span class="icon-tile mint"><%- icon('book') %></span><h2>從第一次練習開始。</h2><p>沒有可顯示的測驗紀錄。</p><a class="button" href="/exams">開始測驗 <%- icon('arrow') %></a></div><% } %>
<%- include('../partials/pagination',{top:false}) %>
